          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A person reports an old observation made in late December 1988 (the case date is arbitrarily assigned). This recent (February 2011) testimony about a 1988 old observation is not precise in terms of date (the witness does not specify the day or the exact time of the observation). Therefore, any investigation is impossible. Nevertheless, the described characteristics could correspond to the observation by numerous witnesses of the national case of 21.12.1988 concerning the atmospheric reentry of a piece of the Cosmos 1954 satellite tank (published on the GEIPAN site: NATIONAL (975) 21.12.1988). Without a precise date allowing this comparison, the case is classified in category C as an impossible investigation.",
